/P 126 0 R
/E (Technology becomes most meaningful when it helps people connect. Inspired by Twinkling Watermelon and its portrayal of communication barriers within the deaf community, I developed SIGNSYNC to explore how computer vision and machine learning could enable real-time sign language translation and support more inclusive communication experiences.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
