223 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 126 0 R
/E (Through this project, I gained hands-on experience in computer vision, machine learning, real-time data processing, and application architecture. I learned how to extract skeletal landmark features using MediaPipe, train classification models with Scikit-Learn, optimize inference workflows, and integrate machine learning systems into user-facing applications. More importantly, this project helped me develop a deeper appreciation for accessibility-focused technology and the communication challenges faced by the deaf and hard-of-hearing community, reinforcing my belief that technology should be inclusive and meaningful for everyone.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [6]
>>
endobj
