/P 126 0 R
/E (In the future, this project could be adapted for edge devices and wearable platforms such as Meta Smart Glasses or Apple Vision-based ecosystems. By combining lightweight machine learning models, real-time landmark detection, and augmented reality interfaces, the system could provide instant sign language interpretation directly within the user's field of view.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [8]
>>
endobj
