/Title (Problem Background : The organization required a more efficient way to manage employee information, website content, and administrative data. Processes such as updating employee profiles, managing news articles, and maintaining organizational records were handled manually, making data management time-consuming and prone to data inconsistencies. To address these challenges, a centralized web-based administrative platform was developed to streamline content management and improve operational efficiency.)
