/Title (What I've Learned : Through this project, I gained hands-on experience in database management, CRUD operations, and web application development using PHP and MySQL. I learned how to design efficient database structures, implement media upload functionality, and build user-friendly administrative interfaces. More importantly, this project strengthened my understanding of real-world software development workflows, problem-solving, and collaboration within a development team.)
